msgid "Effect Catalog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:3
msgid ""
"Effect building blocks that produce visual patterns. In v2, these are "
"used **inside scene functions** that return a pixel canvas directly. The "
"building blocks below operate on grid coordinate arrays and produce "
"`(chars, colors)` or value/hue fields that the scene function renders to "
"canvas via `_render_vf()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:5
msgid ""
