" troubleshooting.md"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:7
msgid "Design Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:9
msgid ""
"Effects are the creative core. Don't copy these verbatim for every "
"project -- use them as **building blocks** and **combine, modify, and "
"invent** new ones. Every project should feel distinct."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:11
msgid "Key principles:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:12
msgid "**Layer multiple effects** rather than using a single monolithic function"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:13
msgid ""
"**Parameterize everything** -- hue, speed, density, amplitude should all "
"be arguments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:14
msgid ""
"**React to features** -- audio/video features should modulate at least "
"2-3 parameters per effect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:15
msgid ""
"**Vary per section** -- never use the same effect config for the entire "
"video"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_effects.md:16
msgid ""
"**Invent project-specific effects** -- the catalog below is a starting "
"vocabulary, not a fixed set"
msgstr ""

